---
/**
 * T3 - Light & Airy
 * Minimal Luxury with Light Typography Weights
 * Base: V24 Dark Luxury
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>T3: Light & Airy | Typografie-Variante</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&family=Libre+Baskerville:ital,wght@0,400;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-gold: #c9a962;
      --color-gold-light: #dbc88a;
      --color-navy: #0a1628;
      --color-navy-light: #132238;
      --color-cream: #f9f7f3;
      --font-sans: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      --font-serif: 'Libre Baskerville', Georgia, serif;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      background: var(--color-navy);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .variant-tag {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-gold);
      color: var(--color-navy);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.4);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }

    .nav a:hover, .nav a.active {
      color: var(--color-cream);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 100px 0 120px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero-line {
      width: 1px;
      height: 60px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--color-gold-light));
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.2;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero h1 em {
      color: var(--color-gold-light);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .hero .lead {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.55);
      line-height: 1.9;
      max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 48px;
      font-weight: 200;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 40px;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      border: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.3);
      color: var(--color-cream);
      background: transparent;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: rgba(201, 169, 98, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--color-gold);
    }

    /* Features */
    .features {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 60px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .feature-line {
      width: 40px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--color-gold-light);
      margin: 0 auto 28px;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.45);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-weight: 200;
    }

    /* Typography Info */
    .typo-info {
      padding: 80px 0;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.05);
    }

    .typo-info h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: var(--color-gold-light);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .font-sample {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 80px;
    }

    .font-sample div {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .font-sample h4 {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: rgba(249, 247, 243, 0.35);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    .sample-serif {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .sample-sans {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--color-cream);
      font-weight: 200;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero h1 { font-size: 2.25rem; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .font-sample { flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="variant-tag">T3: Light & Airy</div>

  <header class="header">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header-inner">
        <a href="/" class="logo">Susanne Hoppe</a>
        <nav class="nav">
          <a href="#" class="active">Home</a>
          <a href="#">Über mich</a>
          <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
          <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-line"></div>
      <h1>Sanfte <em>Osteopathie</em><br>für Ihr Kind</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Begleitende osteopathische Behandlung für Säuglinge, Kinder und ihre Familien –
        einfühlsam und bei Ihnen zuhause in Leipzig.
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">Termin anfragen</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="features">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-line"></div>
          <h3>Bei Ihnen zuhause</h3>
          <p>Entspannte Behandlung in vertrauter Umgebung für Ihr Kind.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-line"></div>
          <h3>Klinische Erfahrung</h3>
          <p>Tätig auf einer Neugeborenenstation mit medizinischer Expertise.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-line"></div>
          <h3>Für die Familie</h3>
          <p>Ganzheitliche Begleitung für Kinder und ihre Familien.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="typo-info">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Typografie dieser Variante</h2>
      <div class="font-sample">
        <div>
          <h4>Serif (Headlines)</h4>
          <p class="sample-serif">Libre Baskerville</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Sans-Serif (Body)</h4>
          <p class="sample-sans">Inter Extra-Light</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
